{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411790/extras/Gif5.gif?t=1741176104\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83c\udfb2 Live to roll another Die</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Grimroll is a tactical roguelike dice game inspired by slavic mythology and folklore where every roll shapes your journey. Use a unique grid-based combat system to modify dice, cross out numbers, and trigger powerful chain reactions. Outsmart mythical foes, master long combos, and carve your path through the cursed woods to reach the Old Crone. Face creatures from ancient Slavic folklore in tactical battles that play like a living puzzle. Each enemy presents a different challenge, forcing you to adapt your strategy on every run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411790/extras/Gif4.gif?t=1741176104\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83d\udd04 Dice Chain Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Engage in a strategic &quot;cross and conquer&quot; system, strike enemies by completing grid patterns, unlock high-powered item bonuses, and refresh gear to keep the momentum going. Build insane synergies where every move fuels the next one, convert dice rolls into devastating chains of attacks, bonus actions, and game-changing rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411790/extras/Gif2.gif?t=1741176104\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f Forge Your Playstyle</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock and equip artifacts, relics, and upgrades to craft unique builds. Combine dice manipulation, defensive strategies, and offensive bursts to suit your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411790/extras/sausages.png?t=1741176104\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3411790?t=1741176104","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411790/9494271a7065919ed99a032b347dc91aabb53ce3/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1741176104","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411790/6be2c02e970e84aedee6e840645539dd00e8217b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741176104","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411790/6be2c02e970e84aedee6e840645539dd00e8217b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1741176104","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411790/extras/Gif5.gif?t=1741176104\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83c\udfb2 Live to roll another Die</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Grimroll is a tactical roguelike dice game inspired by slavic mythology and folklore where every roll shapes your journey. Use a unique grid-based combat system to modify dice, cross out numbers, and trigger powerful chain reactions. Outsmart mythical foes, master long combos, and carve your path through the cursed woods to reach the Old Crone. Face creatures from ancient Slavic folklore in tactical battles that play like a living puzzle. Each enemy presents a different challenge, forcing you to adapt your strategy on every run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/app